### 7. No CORS Policy
**OWASP A05 – Security Misconfiguration**

No CORS headers are configured. Depending on deployment context, this can either be too permissive (default browser behavior for non-credentialed requests) or block legitimate clients. It should be explicitly configured either way.

**✅ Recommendation:**
```js
