### 🔴 Finding 1 — No Authentication or Authorization (OWASP A01: Broken Access Control)

`GET /users` returns a full user list to **any caller with no token, no session, and no role check**. As the app grows, this pattern will expose PII and internal data unconditionally.

**Current code:**
```js
