| 1 | 🔴 Critical | Broken Access Control | `/users` endpoint is completely unauthenticated |
| 2 | 🔴 Critical | Security Misconfiguration | No security headers whatsoever |
| 3 | 🟠 High | Sensitive Data Exposure | User PII served with no authorization or filtering |
| 4 | 🟠 High | Security Misconfiguration | No rate limiting on any endpoint |
| 5 | 🟠 High | Security Misconfiguration | No CORS policy defined |
| 6 | 🟡 Medium | Security Misconfiguration | No body parser — leaves app unprepared for safe POST handling |
